LESSON 18: DESTRUCTURING PROPS
================================================================================

Key Concepts:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
• Destructuring
  - Extract values from objects

• Cleaner Code
  - Avoid repetitive props. prefix

• Default Values
  - Provide fallback values when props are missing

• Modern React Style
  - Commonly used for cleaner component code


Destructuring Example:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Without destructuring

function Book(props) {
  return <h2>{props.title}</h2>
}


// With destructuring

function Book({ title, author, price = 0 }) {
  return (
    <div>
      <h2>{title}</h2>
      <p>{author}</p>
      <p>${price}</p>
    </div>
  )
}


